    "detailed_description": "<strong>Uh-Oh!</strong> It looks like the government has cloned your ridiculous yet strong-willed peanut mercenary team for evil purposes! Take them down in game modes such as Free for All, Team Nutmatch, and Bomb Rush. Are you ready for a NutShot?<br><br>NutShot is a free online fast-paced multiplayer peanut shooter.<br><br><strong>THE GANG</strong><br>Pick between 8 different classes all with unique abilities and personalities.<br><br><strong>UPGRADE YOUR HEAT</strong><br>Collect and find custom weapons then level them up to customize your dream gun. Want a faster fire rate, quicker reload, exploding bullets? The choice is yours.<br><br><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong><br>Create custom games and change the rulesets to fit your desired playstyle, great with friends!<br><br><strong>CLIMB THE RANKS</strong><br>Climb the ranks in all competitive game modes and make your presence known on the global leaderboards.",
